A||||3||Ferrari_cdn||How do you flip down the fuse panel?||||5||
Z||000000||Ferrari_cdn||12-17-2001||07:40 PM||||I blew a fuse when trying to install something, and I remember reading in the "most obscure(sp?) Fiero facts" and someone said you could flip down the fuse panel.  I was wondering how you do that?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ICEFierosig.gif"> AIM: CanadianFiero||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||12-17-2001||07:49 PM||||Grab a hold of the back of the fuse panel and pull down.  It should swing down.||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||12-17-2001||07:52 PM||||There is a latch ear sticking out on 2 sides of the block. You squeeze them and then pull the thing down. It usually pops down a little bit as soon as you relase the locking ears.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fierokid87||12-18-2001||01:55 AM||||The wires will be holding it up a bit though you just have to move it down the rest of the way.<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="red"> Fierokid's  Web site:</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="white">http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero</FONT><P><FONT COLOR="blue">AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG">   <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokid-xmas-sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
